<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insulation materials maker Izolacja SA will put its entire 11.4-million-zloty 1996 net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Shareholders vote on the proposal on May 21.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
